# Glaukos, on the beach by his net. Three questions: the weights, whether the
# strait freezes (his father's walk on the ice), and whether the shore is safe
# at night (the light on the water). No question names what he has not said.
# Text is a key: the panel translates it, so EN/RU stay in strings.csv.
# Indent with tabs: DM's INDENT_REGEX is ^\t+.

~ start
if Game.quest_ready("hook")
	Glaukos: LOC_Q_HOOK_DONE
	do Game.complete_quest("hook")
	=> END
Glaukos: NPC_FISHER_1
Glaukos: NPC_FISHER_2
- LOC_FISHER_CHOICE_1
	Glaukos: NPC_FISHER_4
	Glaukos: LOC_FISHER_WEIGHTS_1
	Glaukos: LOC_FISHER_WEIGHTS_2
- LOC_FISHER_CHOICE_2
	Glaukos: NPC_FISHER_3
	Glaukos: LOC_FISHER_ICE_1
- LOC_FISHER_CHOICE_3
	Glaukos: NPC_FISHER_5
	Glaukos: LOC_FISHER_OMEN_1
- LOC_Q_HOOK_ASK [if Game.quest_offered("hook")]
	Glaukos: LOC_Q_HOOK_1
	Glaukos: LOC_Q_HOOK_2
	do Game.take_quest("hook")
=> END
